    {
      "id": "decided",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 292,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 216,
      "text": "• A dot-matrix display above the table, like a backbox.\n• At rest: score, gold, lives and the current quest.\n• Events take it over for a few seconds, then it returns.\n• Flipper items: a color on each bat; details on the display.\n• No overlay. If it doesn’t fit the display, simplify the game.\n• Boss health is on the toy, not the display.",
      "size": 18,
      "color": "#1f1b16"
    },
